ext":"For how long did the writer give up smoking?","start":12.5,"end":15.8,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-002","sourceId":"b2-078-002","sourceIndex":1,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"After reading an article entitled 'Cigarette Smoking and Your Health' I lit a cigarette to calm my nerves.","start":18.142,"end":26.87,"score":0.907,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-003","sourceId":"b2-078-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I smoked with concentration and pleasure as I was sure that this would be my last cigarette.","start":28.22,"end":35.62,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-004","sourceId":"b2-078-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"For a whole week I did not smoke at all and during this time my wife suffered terribly.","start":37.0,"end":45.08,"score":0.97,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-005","sourceId":"b2-078-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I had all the usual symptoms of someone giving up smoking: a bad temper and an enormous appetite.","start":46.34,"end":54.66,"score":0.973,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-006","sourceId":"b2-078-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"My friends kept on offering me cigarettes and cigars.","start":56.04,"end":60.04,"score":0.933,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-007","sourceId":"b2-078-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They made no effort to hide their amusement whenever I produced a packet of sweets from my pocket.","start":60.62,"end":67.33,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-008","sourceId":"b2-078-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"After seven days of this I went to a party.","start":69.36,"end":73.46,"score":0.992,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-009","sourceId":"b2-078-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Everybody around me was smoking and I felt extremely uncomfortable.","start":74.64,"end":79.79,"score":0.993,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-010","sourceId":"b2-078-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When my old friend Brian urged me to accept a cigarette, it was more than I could bear.","start":81.12,"end":87.26,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-011","sourceId":"b2-078-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I took one guiltily, lit it and smoked with satisfaction.","start":88.49,"end":94.36,"score":0.977,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-012","sourceId":"b2-078-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"My wife was delighted that things had returned to normal once more.","start":95.84,"end":100.12,"score":0.937,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-013","sourceId":"b2-078-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Anyway, as Brian pointed out, it is the easiest thing in the world to give up smoking.","start":101.2,"end":108.4,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-078-014","sourceId":"b2-078-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He himself has done it lots of times!","start":108.93,"end":111.94,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
